。\n令和5年度より固定資産税についてはQR納\n付、コンビニ納付を開始する機会に前納報\n奨金交付対象を口座振替対象者に限定す\nる。","page":null,"sheet":null,"cell":"extracted-text:chars:16086-16267"}],"purpose":"戦後の混乱した経済事情の中における新たな地方税制に対する国民理解と納税意欲を高め、地方財政の基盤を安定化させ、納期前に納付された税金による金利確保を目的として、シャウプ勧告に基づき、昭和25年の地方税施行時から創設された制度。令和5年度より固定資産税についてはQR納付、コンビニ納付を開始する機会に前納報奨金交付対象を口座振替対象者に限定する。"}},{"targetId":"cached-37207-3bf6a338c0fc54b27528a7b8","targetRecordSha256":"4867149a7a313e186781b7506bc1164c6454aad73b357a7ccce93bc358d83880","sheetId":"cached-37207-15bbd07b87aa3a9265d60c2b","add":{"department":null,"amounts":[],"indicators":[],"ratings":[],"evidence":[{"sourceUrl":"https://www.higashikagawa.jp/material/files/group/25/R6_PDCA_all.pdf","sourcePageUrl":"https://www.higashikagawa.jp/material/files/group/25/R6_PDCA_all.pdf","format":"pdf","fetchedAt":"2026-10-21T08:44:38.789Z","sha256":"5573d7aeb13e2005bd50059672b244d68df0f899d9fa0d3a05a6db8d7b734e34","rawText":"\n事務事業名\n\n議会運営事業\n【Plan】 計画","page":null,"sheet":null,"cell":"extracted-text:chars:24-48"},{"sourceUrl":"https://www.higashikagawa.jp/material/files/group/25/R6_PDCA_all.pdf","sourcePageUrl":"https://www.higashikagawa.jp/material/files/group/25/R6_PDCA_all.pdf","format":"pdf","fetchedAt":"2026-10-21T08:44:38.789Z","sha256":"5573d7aeb13e2005bd50059672b244d68df0f899d9fa0d3a05a6db8d7b734e34","rawText":"改選年度の体制づくりを実施し、円滑な\n議会運営に努める。","page":null,"sheet":null,"cell":"extracted-text:chars:133-161"}],"purpose":"改選年度の体制づくりを実施し、円滑な議会運営に努める。"}},{"targetId":"cached-37207-3da3f7a141e6fdde6a3cff5d","targetRecordSha256":"307a7fd31fca09ded8b3a41b673f39811b02e4a23e10ed4eb79b4ac134abc2c6","sheetId":"cached-37207-fc09f10d9c8dad4a72ded23f","add":{"department":null,"amounts":[],"indicators":[],"ratings":[],"evidence":[{"sourceUrl":"https://www.higashikagawa.jp/material/files/group/25/R6_PDCA_all.pdf","sourcePageUrl":"https://www.higashikagawa.jp/material/files/group/25/R6_PDCA_all.pdf","format":"pdf","fetchedAt":"2026-10-21T08:44:38.789Z","sha256":"5573d7aeb13e2005bd50059672b244d68df0f899d9fa0d3